# JEWEL 2.6.0 Au+Au 200 GeV 50-90%: prompt photon + jet (PPYJ)
# pT-hat > 10 GeV, pT-hat weighted; run with set_medium("simple")
# recoils dropped (no medium response); no thermal momenta, no 4MomSub
PROCESS PPYJ
SQRTS 200.
PTMIN 10.
PTMAX -1.
ETAMAX 2.5
PDFSET 13100
MASS 197
NPROTON 79
ISOCHANNEL XX
WEIGHTED T
WEXPO 5.
KEEPRECOILS F
SPLITINTFILE ../../JEWEL_tables/splitint.dat
PDFFILE ../../JEWEL_tables/pdfs_ct14nlo.dat
XSECFILE ../../JEWEL_tables/xsecs_ct14nlo.dat
MEDIUMPARAMS medium_auau200_5090.dat
NF 3
HADRO T
MPI F
SHORTHEPMC T
WRITESCATCEN F
WRITEDUMMIES F
